            <p>All applicants must provide a Statement of Qualifications (SOQ) for the hiring manager’s review. Failure to include an SOQ may disqualify an applicant from consideration. A resume in lieu of the SOQ responses may disqualify an applicant from consideration. A standard or generic SOQ may disqualify an applicant from consideration. Please review the Duty Statement and Desirable Qualifications for the position(s).</p><p><strong>SOQ Format Instructions</strong></p><p>The SOQ should be no more than two pages, single-spaced in 11-point Arial font.</p><p><strong>Please respond to the following prompt, providing detailed examples and explanations where appropriate:</strong></p><ul>
