		<p>Looking for guidance on navigating the state’s job board or need assistance with uploading your documents or SOQ? Check out helpful how-to-videos here: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzDGQ8ghGbWy1BJmIsmuPA0r9o3Wmiwwj">CalCareers &quot;How to:&quot; Videos - YouTube</a> to make your job search easier and more effective!</p>
